WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
 

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.475
I spent my whole life scrapping.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.915
Jealous, hungry, scared.

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:14.895
I want to find something decent.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.620
Something good.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.520
You can be better than me.

00:00:26.575 --> 00:00:27.575
 

00:00:27.805 --> 00:00:28.805
 

00:00:33.715 --> 00:00:35.095
 

00:00:36.075 --> 00:00:37.075
Who is it?

00:00:37.315 --> 00:00:39.005
No ID, no idea.

00:00:39.395 --> 00:00:40.395
 

00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:44.795
 

00:00:45.765 --> 00:00:46.935
I know your whole story.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.600
Placing our agent under cover, she'll look right enough

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:51.900
next to our guy.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.220
 

00:00:54.155 --> 00:00:56.620
If we do this we accept the consequences.
Yes.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.200
 

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.580
Do you love me?

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.460
You know I do.

00:01:04.015 --> 00:01:06.185
You chose to play cops and robbers

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.920
and you lost.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:12.800
Go!

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.560
No you can't.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:21.580
 

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:23.195
 

00:01:23.195 --> 00:01:24.905
 

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.500
 

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:30.620
I'm mad, I'm still mad. It's burnt a circuit in my brain.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:36.620
 

00:01:38.275 --> 00:01:39.275
 

00:01:41.845 --> 00:01:43.165
 

00:01:48.285 --> 00:01:49.285
 

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.300
 

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:02.960
I just want to do one good thing.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.300
 

00:02:10.475 --> 00:02:11.475
 

